      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSIC RETRO (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 3.5 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 22.69 beating Kookaburra Grace. Jumping from the pinch draw but has a good record over this journey. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. WYHOON (4) was quickly into stride and burnt early from out wide where he gave a sight, finishing third (17.29) and beaten 1.75 lengths over 300m at Murray Bridge Straight. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Expected to feature. DOJA ROSE (8) copped a check in the run last time and never threatened when eighth (20.23) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance. LAVENDER LANE (7) hit the frame here last start and can sneak into the finish again.",
